research/audit/wave7-real-analysis-series.proof-contracts.json-5958-          "source_section": "Statement",
research/audit/wave7-real-analysis-series.proof-contracts.json-5959-          "quote": "Let $F$ be an ordered field, with field structure as in [[def-field]], and for\n$n \\ge 1$ let $n \\cdot 1_F$ denote the canonical natural number\n$\\underbrace{1_F + \\cdots + 1_F}_{n}$, defined recursively by $1 \\cdot 1_F = 1_F$\nand $(n+1) \\cdot 1_F = n \\cdot 1_F + 1_F$. Then for every $n \\ge 1$:\n\n- $n \\cdot 1_F > 0$ and $(n+1) \\cdot 1_F > n \\cdot 1_F$;\n- the map $n \\mapsto n \\cdot 1_F$ is strictly increasing, hence injective, on $\\{1, 2, 3, \\dots\\}$;\n- $(m+n) \\cdot 1_F = m \\cdot 1_F + n \\cdot 1_F$ and $(mn) \\cdot 1_F = (m \\cdot 1_F)(n \\cdot 1_F)$ for all $m, n \\ge 1$.",
research/audit/wave7-real-analysis-series.proof-contracts.json-5960-          "uses": [
