items/thm-nonnegative-series-bounded-partial-sums.md-37-Let $(a_k)$ be a sequence of reals with $a_k \ge 0$ for every $k \in \mathbb{N}$,
items/thm-nonnegative-series-bounded-partial-sums.md-38-let $s_n = \sum_{k<n} a_k$ be its partial sums and let
